[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0353","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1356","title":"Ethereal 网络协议分析器 拒绝服务与远程代码执行漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Ethereal 0.9.7 及更早版本中，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送构造恶意的网络数据包来触发漏洞，主要影响 PPP、LMP 和 TDS 等协议解析器。由于 Ethereal 网络协议解析器在处理 EndVerifyAck 消息时缺少必要字段验证，导致内存地址越界访问和资源耗尽，进而引发应用程序崩溃。此外，漏洞还存在潜在的远程代码执行风险，攻击者可能利用内存布局控制实现任意代码运行。该漏洞影响广泛，用户无需任何权限即可触发，攻击成本极低，易于被武器化。微软、安全厂商及开源社区已发布补丁以修复此漏洞，建议用户及时更新到最新版本以获取保护。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1356"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:09Z","remediation":"升级 Ethereal 到支持 EndVerifyAck 消息解析的功能版本（≥0.9.8），或切换到已修复的 Wireshark 1.0+ 版本。如无法立即升级，可通过 Wireshark 配置文件禁用 LMP、PPP 和 TDS  dissector 以消除该特定解析路径的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00007.html","http://www.ethereal.com/cgi-bin/viewcvs.cgi/ethereal/packet-lmp.c#rev1.13","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-290.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1356.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1356.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1356","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1356.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1356.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/94607cd5f476edf9a266e633e1be7e43ab890e1c/2002/CVE-2002-1356.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1356.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1356.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/a36f4d76cddb1767f6fb47db88b804871b726290/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1356.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1356.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0351","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0351.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1355","title":"Ethereal 0.9.7 BGP 协议解析器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ethereal 0.9.7 及更早版本中的 BGP 协议解析模块存在多处整数有符号性错误，远程攻击者可通过向监听网络的 Ethereal 分析工具发送精心构造的畸形 BGP（边界网关协议）消息触发拒绝服务攻击，导致目标系统进入无限循环状态，使 Ethereal 进程挂起或崩溃，从而中断网络监流和分析服务。该漏洞利用无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问权限即可被远程触发，影响范围包括所有使用受影响版本 Ethereal 软件的网络管理和安全监控场景。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1355"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:09Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Ethereal 0.9.8 或更高版本（现已更名为 Wireshark），可从官网 https://www.wireshark.org/download.html 下载最新稳定版。若暂时无法升级，可在网络边界配置防火墙规则过滤异常 BGP 流量，或暂停使用 Ethereal 进行 BGP 报文分析作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00007.html","http://www.ethereal.com/cgi-bin/viewcvs.cgi/ethereal/packet-bgp.c.diff?r1=1.68&r2=1.69","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-290.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1355.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1355.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1355","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1355.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1355.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d31055ab38952b633bc0cc17d118adcd7947f0ed/2002/CVE-2002-1355.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1355.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1355.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/a36f4d76cddb1767f6fb47db88b804871b726290/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1355.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1355.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0351.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0082","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1381","title":"Exim Internet Mailer 格式字符串漏洞","description":"Exim Internet Mailer 的 daemon.c 文件中存在格式字符串漏洞，影响 3.x 至 3.36 及 4.x 至 4.10 版本。具有 Exim 管理权限的本地用户可通过修改 pid_file_path 配置值触发该漏洞，利用格式字符串漏洞在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞CVSS评分为7.2，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1381"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Exim 到 4.11 或更高版本，或应用相关安全补丁（如 Debian squeeze 及更高版本包含修复）。临时缓解措施：通过 chroot 或 SELinux 将 Exim 进程限制在受限用户空间；配置修改：确保 `pid_file_path` 参数仅由受信任用户修改，并在运行时验证其路径安全性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://groups.yahoo.com/group/exim-users/message/42358","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103903403527788&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104006219018664&w=2","http://www.exim.org/pipermail/exim-users/Week-of-Mon-20021202/046978.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6314","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10761","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22066","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1381.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1381","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ed0864e87bec515a12f89ab060c3cbb0a6a56af5/2002/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1381.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1381.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/6bb18b34820034d354785c1f34bbb7285e8899e0/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1381.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0081","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1377","title":"Vim vim 模型行libcall功能任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Vim 6.0 及 6.1 版本（可能包括其他版本）的 modeline 功能中存在 libcall 特性未正确沙箱化的问题。当用户使用 vim 编辑恶意构造的文件时，攻击者可通过 modeline 中的 libcall 调用执行任意系统命令，例如通过 mutt 邮件客户端触发。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者需诱使用户打开恶意文件，影响范围涉及 Vim 6.x 系列版本，可导致任意命令执行，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1377"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:12Z","remediation":"升级 Vim 至 6.2 及以上版本，该版本已对 modeline 中的 libcall 功能实施沙箱隔离。如无法升级，在 vimrc 中设置 set modelines=0 禁用 modeline 解析，或设置 set secure 启用安全模式限制 modeline 执行权限。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2002:297 提供的修补版 vim-6.1-5.8，Solaris 用户安装 Sun 补丁 55700。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000812","http://lists.grok.org.uk/pipermail/full-disclosure/2002-December/002948.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=108077992208690&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doc=fsalert/55700","http://www.guninski.com/vim1.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:012","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-297.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-302.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6384","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10835","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1377.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1377.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1377.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1377","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1377.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1377.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1377.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1377.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71d64a6d3b3901a67b0e17d4598d8a385b75e78d/2002/CVE-2002-1377.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1377.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0074","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0074.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1365","title":"Fetchmail 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Fetchmail 6.1.3 及更早版本存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞在解析邮件头部中的本地邮件地址时，未正确考虑 \"@\" 字符的长度计算，导致缓冲区大小分配不当。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向邮件服务器发送包含大量本地地址的特制邮件头数据包触发该溢出漏洞，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 Fetchmail 作为邮件客户端的服务器系统，攻击者可利用此漏洞完全控制受影响的系统，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需任何前置权限或交互即可远程利用此漏洞，仅需向目标发送一封构造好的恶意邮件即可实现攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1365"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:11Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Fetchmail 到 6.1.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复缓冲区长度计算中未正确处理 \"@\" 字符的问题。升级前可从官方源（fetchmail.sourceforge.io）获取补丁包，通过包管理器或手动编译安装。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙或邮件网关处过滤包含大量本地地址的邮件头字段，或暂时禁用 Fetchmail 的本地地址解析功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000554","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103979751818638&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104004858802000&w=2","http://security.e-matters.de/advisories/052002.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-216","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:011","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-293.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-294.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-155.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6390","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10839","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1365.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/976754950fcf68c46d91206b7029022222e8684c/2002/CVE-2002-1365.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14587a553af4d49d5605e1beebb7fda4e5c12c66/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1365.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1365.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1365.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1365","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1365.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/71f75a103b941c0c3ce508c66efcf3c78d28c6a8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1365.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1365.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7938040077b96e376900d931f1858b2fcc07c974/2002/CVE-2002-1365.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0074.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0073","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1350","title":"LBL tcpdump 3.6.x BGP Dissector 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"LBL tcpdump 3.6.x 版本（3.7 之前）的 BGP 协议解析模块存在数据拷贝缺陷，远程攻击者无需认证即可发送特制的 BGP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致 tcpdump 进程崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 tcpdump 的系统，攻击向量为网络远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH）。升级至 tcpdump 3.7 或更高版本可修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1350"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:09Z","remediation":"升级到tcpdump 3.7或更高版本以修复BGP解码例程中的缓冲区复制问题。该版本修复了CVE-2002-1350中的漏洞，可防止攻击者通过精心构造的BGP数据包导致tcpdump崩溃。如果无法立即升级，可在命令行中启用'--disable-bgp'选项以临时禁用BGP解码功能。此外，建议更新到最新的维护版本以获取所有安全补丁，并在网络环境中部署入侵检测系统以监控异常BGP流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032975103398&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-206","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:027","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-032.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-033.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-214.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6213","http://www.tcpdump.org/lists/workers/2001/10/msg00101.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10695","https://github.com/CVEPro