地 POP3 代理服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://kb.trendmicro.com/solutions/solutionDetail.asp?solutionId=12982","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103953822705917&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/157961","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6350","http://www.texonet.com/advisories/TEXONET-20021210.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10814","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22082","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1349.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1349","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1349.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1349.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/881dc8aad9cc7f4353e5388bbdaaeb83a2e3abe3/2002/CVE-2002-1349.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1349.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1349.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1349.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1349.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1349.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0571.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0337","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0337.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1341","title":"SquirrelMail SquirrelMail 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"SquirrelMail 1.2.10、1.2.9及更早版本的read_body.php文件中存在跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过在mailbox或passed_id参数中注入恶意脚本和HTML代码发起攻击。当用户访问包含恶意构造参数的邮件页面时，注入的脚本将在受害者的浏览器中以当前用户权限执行，导致Cookie泄露、会话劫持、敏感邮件内容窃取或页面内容篡改等危害。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本SquirrelMail的Web邮件系统，攻击条件为攻击者能够诱使或强制用户访问包含恶意构造URL的页面。利用方式为构造包含JavaScript代码的特殊URL并发送给目标用户，一旦用户点击链接即可触发漏洞执行。Debian、Red Hat等发行版已发布安全公告和补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1341"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 SquirrelMail 1.4.20 或更高版本，该版本修复了 read_body.php 中的 XSS 漏洞。升级时请确保同时更新所有依赖组件，包括 PHP 版本要求为 5.6+。如无法立即升级，可在 Apache/Nginx 配置中添加参数 `AcceptPathInfo=OFF` 和 `Options -MultiViews` 以缓解 XSS 风险，并严格验证 mailbox 和 passed_id 参数输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://f0kp.iplus.ru/bz/008.txt","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103893844126484&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103911130503272&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104004924002662&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/8220","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-220","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-042.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6302","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10754","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e3ffc8aa96e889e4591b3a2ccc4e1f7e6b2ab4fc/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1341.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1341","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1341.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2002-1341","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2002-1341","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e8af837966f4fe349aac88609ed5288e4a877c95/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2002-1341","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1341.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/050f0b0b35f5586b897c9fa1e5cb22907b6f29e8/2002/CVE-2002-1341.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1341.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1341.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0337.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0071","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1347","title":"Cyrus SASL 库 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cyrus SASL 库 2.1.9 及更早版本存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未经认证的攻击者可通过发送超长用户名规范化输入、LDAP 认证时需转义的特殊字符，或利用日志记录器的越界写入缺陷（未为字符串结束符分配空间），触发缓冲区溢出导致拒绝服务甚至任意代码执行。该漏洞影响使用 Cyrus SASL 进行身份认证的各类服务（如 SMTP、IMAP、LDAP 等），CVSS 评分 9.8 级别为严重，攻击无需用户交互且可远程利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1347"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:08Z","remediation":"升级 Cyrus SASL 库至 2.1.10 或更高版本（官方已在 2.1.10 中修复此缓冲区溢出）。若暂时无法升级，可在应用层限制用户名/认证输入长度，并在防火墙层面阻断非必要的 SASL 认证端口（如 25、587、143、993、110、995 等）对外暴露，或临时禁用 saslauthd LDAP 认证模块以阻断攻击向量 (2)。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2002-q4/1275.html","http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000557","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2005/Mar/msg00000.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103946297703402&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-215","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-283.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/4826","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6347","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6348","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6349","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10810","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10811","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10812","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1347.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1347","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1347.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ce1c7bf4468f226d3b5ffdf52fb2db0cd4a31a97/2002/CVE-2002-1347.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1347.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1347.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1347.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/a36f4d76cddb1767f6fb47db88b804871b726290/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1347.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1347.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1347.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0070","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1344","title":"GNU wget 目录遍历漏洞","description":"wget 1.8.2-4 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程 FTP 服务器可通过构造包含绝对路径（/absolute/path）或相对路径遍历序列（..）的文件名，诱导 wget 客户端下载时以 wget 用户权限任意创建或覆盖本地文件系统中的文件。该漏洞源于 wget 在处理 FTP 服务器返回的文件名时未充分验证路径合法性，攻击者仅需控制或伪造恶意 FTP 服务器，即可在受害者执行 wget 下载命令时触发漏洞，导致任意文件写入，可能进一步实现代码执行或系统配置篡改。影响所有使用受影响版本 wget 从不可信 FTP 源下载文件的用户。CVSS 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:N），建议升级至 1.8.2-4 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1344"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:08Z","remediation":"升级 wget 到 1.8.2-4 或更高版本以获取补丁修复目录遍历漏洞，并确保安全路径验证机制生效，可在配置中启用 `--restrict-file-names=unix` 限制文件名格式，禁止包含路径遍历序列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0102.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000552","http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000552","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103962838628940&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104033016703851&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-022.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10820.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/210148","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-086.php","http://www.openpkg.com/security/advisories/OpenPKG-SA-2003.007.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-229.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-256.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/307045/30/26300/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6352","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6360","https://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-209","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/550055bfe9781275ad9633a348ccd82fcad2554b/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1344.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1344","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8d0003712fd6ee4e2d0881313cc643a9a3a69d63/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1344.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/357993977f72e369f2153b52815028afa3f5ba9d/2002/CVE-2002-1344.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1344.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1344.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1344.json","https://github.com