blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0570","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0570.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1334","title":"BizDesign ImageFolio 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"tags.<value>BizDesign ImageFolio 2.x 及 3.0.1 及更早版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向 imageFolio.cgi 的 direct 参数或 nph-build.cgi 脚本中注入恶意脚本代码，当其他用户访问包含恶意脚本的页面时，脚本会在其浏览器中以当前用户身份执行。攻击者可借此窃取会话令牌、执行未授权操作或重定向用户至恶意网站。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本部署的 Web 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1334"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:07Z","remediation":"立即升级至 ImageFolio 3.1 或更高版本（若厂商确已发布修复补丁），并确保 `nph-build.cgi` 和 `imageFolio.cgi` 中的 `direct` 及 `step` 参数对用户输入进行严格过滤，移除或转义 HTML 特殊字符（`<`、`>`、`\"`、`'`、`&`）。如厂商已停止维护且无法获取补丁，建议迁移至持续更新的图库系统，并在 Web 服务器或前端 WAF 层面配置规则拦截含 `<script>`、`javascript:`、`onload=`、`onerror=` 等特征的 XSS 载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103842773205148&w=2","http://securitytracker.com/id?1005681","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6265","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10718","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22051","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1334.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1334","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1334.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1334.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1334.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d343bea8cfc0d9952499ddc0950571762ca42cd/2002/CVE-2002-1334.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1334.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1334.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1334.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1334.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0570.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0569","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0569.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1322","title":"IBM Rational ClearCase 4.1 端口扫描拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Rational ClearCase 4.1 及 2002.05 等版本在 371 端口处理网络数据包时存在拒绝服务漏洞。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 371 端口发送特制数据包触发该漏洞，导致服务进程崩溃。该漏洞利用门槛极低，攻击者可借助 nmap 等端口扫描工具向该端口发送探测包即可触发，造成软件配置管理服务中断，影响开发团队的版本管理与协同工作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1322"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:06Z","remediation":"Rational 于 2002 年 11 月发布了针对受影响版本的补丁：ClearCase 2002.05/Solaris 用户应安装 clearcase_p2002.05.00-12 和 clearcase_p2002.05.00-15；ClearCase 4.1 用户因官方提供的 4.1 补丁经测试仍无法修复该问题，建议直接升级到更新版本。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或 iptables 中限制非必要来源对 TCP 371 端口的访问，并监控 albd_server 进程状态，崩溃后及时重启 ClearCase 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0084.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103808239618238&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6228","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10675","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22031","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1322.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1322.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-lis